  "project_description": "Form Tips module uses JavaScript to move form description/help text to tooltips.\n\n It helps to reduce form clutter by removing form descriptions from the page and only displaying them when needed.\n\n Back to top \n\n Drupal 8 \n The functionality is the same as earlier versions but with a bit easier to modify CSS and the image was replaced with CSS.\n\n Back to top \n\n Drupal 7 & 6 \n Examples \n Please see the screencast showing how the Views 6.x add fields form looks with this module enabled.\n\n Back to top",
